## Goal

My goal from this project is:
- I always wanted to learn how to code this type of algorithms and I want to improve my coding skills and my knowledge about it, since cryptography is my favourite area
- I want to build my own personal Password Manager, and give the possibility for other to have a secure password manager without having to trust another company with your data, all with implementing the latest cryptography recommendations and be transparent.


